WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:03.889
Hey guys, a ton of people have been reaching
out to me telling me they're being automatically

00:00:03.889 --> 00:00:07.990
unsubscribed from our YouTube Channel, or
letting me know they're no longer seeing our

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:11.620
videos in their feed.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.970
If you haven't seen any of our videos lately,
I promise you, we're not on a break, we're

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:20.759
still releasing at least one full interview
per week, and oftentimes more.

00:00:20.759 --> 00:00:24.830
Make sure you're signed up for notifications
wherever you may watch The Rubin Report to

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:27.599
check out our new content as it's released!

00:00:27.599 --> 00:00:32.469
For YouTube viewers, double check to make
sure you're subscribed, and click the bell

00:00:32.469 --> 00:00:36.239
icon by the subscribe button to get alerts
as videos are posted.

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:42.030
If you play along on Facebook, make sure you've
both liked and followed The Rubin Report and

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:47.340
Dave Rubin, or if Twitter is your thing, give
me a follow @RubinReport.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:51.929
And, last but not least, if you prefer to
listen via podcast, The Rubin Report is available

00:00:51.929 --> 00:00:57.859
on an array of players, including Apple, Stitcher,
Spotify, or, just subscribe to our RSS feed

00:00:57.859 --> 00:01:01.089
in whatever app you prefer, link is in the
description below.

00:01:01.089 --> 00:01:05.850
And, of course, if you want to check out some
premium content in addition to our regular

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:11.460
interviews, head over to patreon.com/RubinReport
and sign up to be a monthly supporter.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.020
We've built a really cool, interactive community
over there that I'm truly proud of, and there's

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:20.070
a ton of great perks and bonuses at a variety
of donation levels.

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:23.490
No matter how you consume The Rubin Report,
my team and I thank you for your continued

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:27.990
support, and we look forward to bringing you
even more exciting and diverse content and

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:30.020
conversation in the future.

